According to first round discussion, Please rapporteurs modify the CRs and upload the new version for review. Specifically, For R3-220852[10] , modify CR category and correct References in sections 1, 2 and 9 to 37.480 For R3-220846[11], reflect changes endorsed in BL CR R3-220044 with visible remarks. For R3-220918[12], Fix the types in the ‘other comments’ part of cover sheet. In section 1, replace 37.4xx by 37.482. Also, add a new section (8 - E1 signalling transport) referring to TS 37.481. Release number in the CR cover page should be Release 17. For R3-220919[13], Remove the term “NG-RAN” from the title of the spec. and title of references [7], [8], and [9] in Sec. 2 “References”. Reflect changes endorsed in BL CR R3-220018 with visible remarks. The Release number should be Release 17 For R3-220634[14], Use the correct specification number on title page. The term “NG-RAN” should be removed from the title of references [3] and [18] in Sec. 2 “References”. In 8.3.13.2, the title of the figure 8.3.x.2-1., should be figure 8.3.13.2-1 Reflect the changes in agreed TPs and BL CR R3-220019 with visible remarks. For R3-220635[15], the CR category should be “F” For R3-220843[16], Correct the typo in the cover sheet Add a new section (5 - E1 layer 1) referring to TS 37.481 For R3-220844[17], add the missing cover page. Please Rapporteurs modify CRs/new spec according to the above listed points. And please companies provide further comments to the revised version, if any, in the below table:

